      {
        "id": "predict-sentiment",
        "moduleId": "training-and-prediction",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "预测函数与两个例子",
        "markdown": "教材定义 `predict_sentiment(net, vocab, sequence)`：先把按空格切分的句子映射为词表索引张量，再用 `net(sequence.reshape(1, -1))` 得到两个类别的输出，取 argmax 后按 `label == 1` 返回 positive，否则返回 negative。\n\n用它预测两个短句：'this movie is so great' 得到 positive，'this movie is so bad' 得到 negative。",
